      "title": "File:People's Park standoff, August 3, 2022.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/People%27s_Park_standoff%2C_August_3%2C_2022.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
